5,0,1,talk,Rin,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play! Since it's Day 0, we don't have any clues yet, but I'm going to do my best to find the werewolf! Who do you think looks suspicious already?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"It's too early to call anyone suspicious, Rin. We have no information yet. Let's observe how everyone speaks and reacts before we jump to any conclusions.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Toshio. Since we have no data, jumping to conclusions would be illogical. Let's use this time to get a feel for everyone's communication style. Does anyone have a specific strategy they'd like to suggest?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree with the general consensus. Since we lack evidence, we should focus on identifying contradictions in our statements once the game progresses. For now, I will simply observe and listen to everyone's logic.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Everyone is being far too cautious. While observing is fine, the way you're all agreeing so perfectly is almost boring. Let's see who breaks this polite facade first. I'll be watching you all very closely.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shion, you're so mean! I'm not being polite, I'm just happy! But you're right, it is a bit quiet. Maybe the werewolf is hiding behind all this ""logic"" and ""observation"" talk? I'll be watching too!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, your enthusiasm is noted, but let's not confuse energy with evidence. @Shion's observation is a bit cynical, but he's right that the atmosphere is stagnant. I'm interested to see who tries to lead the conversation next.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, you're always so detached. While I agree we need evidence, we can still test people's reactions. @Shion, since you find us boring, why don't you tell us how you'd identify a werewolf without any clues?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mizuki, testing reactions is a valid approach, but it can be misleading. People react differently based on personality, not just their role. I'm more interested in seeing who tries to manipulate the flow of the conversation.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mizuki, you're asking for my method? Simple. I look for the gaps between what people say and what they actually want. The werewolf will try too hard to blend in or steer the narrative. I'm just waiting for the slip-up.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Rin,,"Gaps and slip-ups? That sounds like a detective movie! I'll help you look for them, @Shion! But if you're too busy being a cool detective, you might miss something obvious! I'm going to keep everyone's words in my head!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Rin, your memory will be useful, but don't let your excitement cloud your judgment. @Shion, your approach is focused on psychology, which is fine, but let's not forget that the Seer's information will be the most concrete lead.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Toshio, you're right about the Seer. However, the Seer is a prime target for the werewolf. We must be careful about how that information is revealed so we don't lose our most valuable asset too early.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Mizuki, that is a logical point. If the Seer reveals themselves too early, they will be eliminated immediately. We should encourage the Seer to share information strategically rather than all at once.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Strategically, huh? You're all so focused on the ""correct"" way to play. It's almost as if you're reading from a manual. I wonder if the werewolf is the one trying hardest to sound like a perfect teammate.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Rin,,"Everyone is getting so serious! But @Shion is right, maybe the werewolf is just pretending to be a good teammate. I'll be super careful! Good luck tonight, everyone! I hope we find the werewolf soon!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Toshio,,"Let's keep our composure. Tomorrow, we'll have the first set of results and a vote. Until then, I'll be reflecting on today's patterns. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,"I'll be doing the same, Toshio. I'm curious to see how the dynamics shift once we have actual information to work with. Sleep well, everyone. I'll see you all tomorrow.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,Asuka,,I will also be analyzing the patterns of today's discussion. Let's hope the Seer's divination provides a clear starting point for tomorrow. Good night.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,0,4,talk,Shion,,Good night. I'll be dreaming of all the little cracks that will start appearing in your perfect logic tomorrow. Don't let your guards down too much.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
